{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/page,_N_T_/products/bl-cvx160"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$c$slug/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/1yexyjxngf5x1.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/19mx3mg6lkumu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02fh7_m5mrih8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2-rtuqsgzmno4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3i1tnniunbom4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>CreativeVault 1.6mm LED Display - Ultra HD Visuals Dubai | Brightluxx</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover the CreativeVault 1.6mm ultra-fine pixel LED display in Dubai. Elevate your visuals with Brightluxx. Contact us in UAE today!\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cvx160\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"site-header\" data-testid=\"site-header-nav\"><div class=\"site-header__inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" data-testid=\"logo-link\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\"><button data-testid=\"nav-products\">PRODUCTS <span>⌄</span></button><button data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"CreativeVault 1.6mm\", \"description\": \"Purpose-built for sculptural and immersive installations. Flexible module design allows concave, convex, and irregular shapes, transforming architectural spaces into experiential media environments.\", \"sku\": \"BL-CVX160\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cvx160\", \"category\": \"flexible\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-cvx160.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 1200, \"highPrice\": 8000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cvx160\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.6mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"320 x 160 per module\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the CreativeVault 1.6mm and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The CreativeVault features a 1.6mm pixel pitch, delivering high-resolution visuals ideal for close viewing distances. This fine pitch ensures crisp, detailed images, making it perfect for immersive and artistic installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How flexible is the CreativeVault 1.6mm LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display supports full 360-degree curvature with a minimum radius of 500mm, allowing for concave, convex, and irregular shapes. Its flexibility enables unique, sculptural designs tailored to creative architectural environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation options for the CreativeVault 1.6mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The CreativeVault uses rear magnetic service access, facilitating quick and easy maintenance without dismantling the entire structure. This simplifies installation and servicing in complex or large-scale curved setups.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the brightness of 800 nits affect its usage?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With 800 nits brightness, this LED panel performs well in controlled lighting environments like museums and experience centres. While not designed for direct outdoor sunlight, it offers vibrant, clear visuals indoors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty and dedicated support for the CreativeVault 1.6mm, ensuring reliability and peace of mind. Specific warranty details can be obtained upon inquiry to match project requirements.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the CreativeVault 1.6mm compare to standard fixed flat LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike standard flat panels, the CreativeVault\\u2019s flexible design enables creative curved and three-dimensional media installations. Its fine pixel pitch and high contrast ratio allow for superior visual quality in immersive environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of venues are best suited for the CreativeVault 1.6mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ideal venues include museums and experience centres where immersive and artistic media installations enhance visitor engagement. Its ability to conform to complex shapes makes it perfect for architectural storytelling.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the CreativeVault 1.6mm suitable for outdoor applications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product is designed primarily for indoor, controlled lighting environments due to its brightness and pixel pitch. For outdoor or high ambient light locations, other LED solutions with higher brightness are recommended.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"CreativeVault 1.6mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cvx160\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>CreativeVault 1.6mm</h1><p>Discover the CreativeVault 1.6mm ultra-fine pixel LED display in Dubai. Elevate your visuals with Brightluxx. Contact us in UAE today!</p><p><strong>Curved, shaped, limitless.</strong></p><p>Purpose-built for sculptural and immersive installations. Flexible module design allows concave, convex, and irregular shapes, transforming architectural spaces into experiential media environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the CreativeVault 1.6mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The CreativeVault features a 1.6mm pixel pitch, delivering high-resolution visuals ideal for close viewing distances. This fine pitch ensures crisp, detailed images, making it perfect for immersive and artistic installations.</p><h3>How flexible is the CreativeVault 1.6mm LED display?</h3><p>This display supports full 360-degree curvature with a minimum radius of 500mm, allowing for concave, convex, and irregular shapes. Its flexibility enables unique, sculptural designs tailored to creative architectural environments.</p><h3>What are the installation options for the CreativeVault 1.6mm?</h3><p>The CreativeVault uses rear magnetic service access, facilitating quick and easy maintenance without dismantling the entire structure. This simplifies installation and servicing in complex or large-scale curved setups.</p><h3>How does the brightness of 800 nits affect its usage?</h3><p>With 800 nits brightness, this LED panel performs well in controlled lighting environments like museums and experience centres. While not designed for direct outdoor sunlight, it offers vibrant, clear visuals indoors.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></