nnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n6:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T661,<h1>CreativeVault 1.6mm</h1><p>Discover the CreativeVault 1.6mm ultra-fine pixel LED display in Dubai. Elevate your visuals with Brightluxx. Contact us in UAE today!</p><p><strong>Curved, shaped, limitless.</strong></p><p>Purpose-built for sculptural and immersive installations. Flexible module design allows concave, convex, and irregular shapes, transforming architectural spaces into experiential media environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the CreativeVault 1.6mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The CreativeVault features a 1.6mm pixel pitch, delivering high-resolution visuals ideal for close viewing distances. This fine pitch ensures crisp, detailed images, making it perfect for immersive and artistic installations.</p><h3>How flexible is the CreativeVault 1.6mm LED display?</h3><p>This display supports full 360-degree curvature with a minimum radius of 500mm, allowing for concave, convex, and irregular shapes. Its flexibility enables unique, sculptural designs tailored to creative architectural environments.</p><h3>What are the installation options for the CreativeVault 1.6mm?</h3><p>The CreativeVault uses rear magnetic service access, facilitating quick and easy maintenance without dismantling the entire structure. This simplifies installation and servicing in complex or large-scale curved setups.</p><h3>How does the brightness of 800 nits affect its usage?</h3><p>With 800 nits brightness, this LED panel performs well in controlled lighting environments like museums and experience centres. While not designed for direct outdoor sunlight, it offers vibrant, clear visuals indoors.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"